{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor conducted a thorough multi-turn assessment covering symptom review, medication reconciliation from record-grounded synthesis, explicit urgent escalation thresholds, and a concrete follow-up plan with owner/timing/materials while adapting the plan to the family's transport and cost barriers. No responsibility-chain errors were identified; all high-order points (HO1-HO4) were triggered and actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact, and the trajectory satisfied all five dimensions at least at the good level, leading to a Perfect grade.",
